      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "KatarinaQ",
        "name": "弹射之刃",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "卡特琳娜朝敌人扔出一把<font color='#FFF673'>匕首</font>，<font color='#FFF673'>匕首</font>会弹射到附近敌人身上，然后落到地面上。",
        "bodyHtml": "卡特琳娜投掷一把<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">匕首</span>，造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/115/150/185/220 + (40% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>给目标及附近的2个敌人。<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">匕首</span>随后会弹落到主要目标身后的地面上。",
